{"id":"fd52635f93837cdf","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal.md","title":"Proof-theoretic Ordinal","display":"df-proof-theoretic-ordinal — Proof-theoretic Ordinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal","aliases":["72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal"],"display":"df-proof-theoretic-ordinal — Proof-theoretic Ordinal","depends_on":["[[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]","[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]","[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.3.4, print228–229/PDF240–241","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-theoretic-ordinal — Proof-theoretic Ordinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9cc4e14a96f221dc\" href=\"?note=9cc4e14a96f221dc\" title=\"72-df-recursive-order-presentation\">72-df-recursive-order-presentation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.3.4, print228–229/PDF240–241"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)\">\\(T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\supseteq E_{\\rm PR}\">\\(E\\supseteq E_{\\rm PR}\\)</span>，并固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a> 的有效有限演算。要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR}\\subseteq T\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR}\\subseteq T\\)</span>，其中 PR 函数符号及其定义方程取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e5fb64772853785\" href=\"?note=5e5fb64772853785\" title=\"72-df-peano-arithmetic\">72-df-peano-arithmetic</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRWO},o(e),\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{PRWO},o(e),\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9cc4e14a96f221dc\" href=\"?note=9cc4e14a96f221dc\" title=\"72-df-recursive-order-presentation\">72-df-recursive-order-presentation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是自由集变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)\">\\(T\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)\\)</span> 是有限可证性，不是将元理论的所有子集直接塞进对象语言。未加限定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathsf{PA}|\">\\(|\\mathsf{PA}|\\)</span> 按书中自由集参数保守扩展约定读取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathsf{NT}|\">\\(|\\mathsf{NT}|\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal W_T&amp;:=\\{e\\in\\operatorname{PRWO}:T\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)\\},\\\\\n|T|_{\\Pi^1_1}&amp;:=\\sup\\{o(e):e\\in\\mathcal W_T\\},\\\\\n|T|&amp;:=|T|_{\\Pi^1_1},\\qquad |\\mathsf{PA}|:=|\\mathsf{NT}|.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal W_T&amp;:=\\{e\\in\\operatorname{PRWO}:T\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)\\},\\\\\n|T|_{\\Pi^1_1}&amp;:=\\sup\\{o(e):e\\in\\mathcal W_T\\},\\\\\n|T|&amp;:=|T|_{\\Pi^1_1},\\qquad |\\mathsf{PA}|:=|\\mathsf{NT}|.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这修复原14↔15循环和原Π⁰₁下标：本书此处采用Π¹₁/带自由集参数超限归纳约定。PR程序集合可数，因此上确界存在且可数；对空集合取0。不一致理论也有该形式赋值，故此定义本身不构成可靠性或一致性保证。若只用一阶TI模式，必须另声明不同的序数约定，不能无说明替换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-recursive-order-presentation","status":"resolved","id":"9cc4e14a96f221dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-two-sorted-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"b63a805280ad1d8e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-two-sorted-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"b63a805280ad1d8e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)$，$E\\supseteq E_{\\rm PR}$，并固定 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]] 的有效有限演算。要求 $\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR}\\subseteq T$，其中 PR 函数符号及其定义方程取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]；$\\operatorname{PRWO},o(e),\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)$ 见 [[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"5e5fb64772853785","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)$，$E\\supseteq E_{\\rm PR}$，并固定 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]] 的有效有限演算。要求 $\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR}\\subseteq T$，其中 PR 函数符号及其定义方程取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]；$\\operatorname{PRWO},o(e),\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)$ 见 [[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-recursive-order-presentation","status":"resolved","id":"9cc4e14a96f221dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)$，$E\\supseteq E_{\\rm PR}$，并固定 [[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]] 的有效有限演算。要求 $\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR}\\subseteq T$，其中 PR 函数符号及其定义方程取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]；$\\operatorname{PRWO},o(e),\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)$ 见 [[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_2(E)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\supseteq E_{\\rm PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\rm PR}\\subseteq T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PRWO},o(e),\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathsf{PA}|","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathsf{NT}|","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal W_T&:=\\{e\\in\\operatorname{PRWO}:T\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)\\},\\\\\n|T|_{\\Pi^1_1}&:=\\sup\\{o(e):e\\in\\mathcal W_T\\},\\\\\n|T|&:=|T|_{\\Pi^1_1},\\qquad |\\mathsf{PA}|:=|\\mathsf{NT}|.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1885,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal|df-proof-theoretic-ordinal — Proof-theoretic Ordinal]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-236","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-proof-theoretic-ordinal — Proof-theoretic Ordinal](72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal.md)"},{"id":"f37fed96637e692d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ 是 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 约定适用的理论，$\\Gamma_0$ 取 [[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]。下式限定为Pohlers本书IV§3.1明确声明的技术用语，下标P98是该限定的一部分。"},{"id":"de8a2a5170e43df9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$、$\\mathcal W_T$、$o(e)$ 与 $|T|$ 如 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]；$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$。下式的序数比较在ZFC元理论中，$T\\vdash_2\\operatorname{TI}_e(X)$ 在固定对象演算中。"},{"id":"358c7e197917c7a7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ 是 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 约定适用的理论，$\\Gamma_0$ 取 [[72-df-feferman-schutte-ordinal]]。下式限定为Pohlers本书IV§3.1明确声明的技术用语，下标P98是该限定的一部分。"},{"id":"2a3dd589d6e4050f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$T_1,T_2$ are formal theories to which the proof-theoretic ordinal convention of [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] applies"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-254","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal|df-proof-theoretic-ordinal — Proof-theoretic Ordinal]]"},{"id":"58974046a284c742","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{ID}_n$ 是 [[72-df-id-theory]] 的全部正算子有限迭代版本，$|T|$ 为 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 的约定。$\\Omega_\\nu,\\varepsilon_\\eta,\\psi_\\nu,\\mathrm{BH}$ 取 [[72-df-buchholz-psi]] 的具体定义；不是任意命名的ψ。"},{"id":"7db447da07adcf15","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{ID}_n$ 是 [[72-df-id-theory]] 的全部正算子有限迭代版本，$|T|$ 为 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]] 的约定。$\\Omega_\\nu,\\varepsilon_\\eta,\\psi_\\nu,\\mathrm{BH}$ 取 [[72-df-buchholz-psi]] 的具体定义；不是任意命名的ψ。"},{"id":"8f89d4e14473676b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{NT}$ 取 [[72-df-peano-arithmetic]]，$|\\mathsf{PA}|:=|\\mathsf{NT}|$ 取 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]。$\\varepsilon_0$ 取同名定义。"},{"id":"a370c651bd39d70c","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"各系统取本目录明确的公理定义，使用其PR保守扩展；$|T|$ 取 [[72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]。$\\varepsilon_0,\\Gamma_0$ 分别如同名定义；坍缩函数严格采用 [[72-df-buchholz-psi]]。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-228","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-proof-theoretic-ordinal]]"}],"outgoing":["9cc4e14a96f221dc","b63a805280ad1d8e","5e5fb64772853785"]}